{"ts": "2026-08-17T13:47:07Z", "agent": "claude", "seq": 52, "kind": "tool_result", "text": "---\n1f55f16 WIP round 9 (Let me undo deleting a task): pipeline finished\n3c8a6a5 Give tasks a due date (Taiga #12)\n2b6cbd5 Merge round 8: Give tasks a due date\n7c1276f Search tasks by title (Taiga #11)\n5e852f6 Merge round 7: Search tasks by title\n9c496a8 Show me how many tasks are left (Taiga #10)\n255db69 Merge round 6: Show me how many tasks are left\n3932a70 Clear all completed tasks at once (Taiga #9)\ncde0e88 Merge round 5: Clear all completed tasks at once\n9c6eea4 Merge round 4: keep tasks when the server restarts\n9927633 Keep tasks when the server restarts (Taiga #5)\ne83b051 Give tasks a priority (Taiga #4)\n01bce3e Merge round 3: Give tasks a priority\n12423bd Edit a task title (Taiga #3)\n531fc28 Merge round 2: Edit a task title\n2437cae Merge round 1: filter tasks by done state\n72effca Stop the e2e harness orphaning its dev servers\n7e4f0a8 Filter tasks by done state (Taiga #1)\n5a1027e Allow the pipeline roles to work without an approval prompt\n7c433e9 Scaffold the task-tracker app the pipeline builds against\n---branches---\n  feature/te-1/filter-tasks-by-done-state\n  feature/tp-10/show-how-many-tasks-are\n  feature/tp-11/search-tasks-by-title\n  feature/tp-12/give-tasks-due-date\n  feature/tp-13/let-undo-deleting-task\n* feature/tp-14/make-app-usable-from-keyboard\n  feature/tp-3/edit-task-title\n  feature/tp-4/give-tasks-priority\n  feature/tp-5/keep-tasks-when-server-restarts\n  feature/tp-9/clear-all-completed-tasks-at\n  master\n  remotes/gitea/feature/te-1/filter-tasks-by-done-state\n  remotes/gitea/main\n  remotes/gitea/master\n---diff design vs spec dates---\n2026-08-17 13:23:54.116346601 +0000 docs/spec.md\n2026-08-17 13:27:11.593633234 +0000 docs/design.md\n2026-08-17 13:36:15.589687000 +0000 docs/implementation.md", "meta": {"native_type": "user", "tool_use_id": "toolu_01XaUJv1kGu4tvuriWE1aG6X", "session_id": "2837eeec-4555-4bd5-a94f-21d7d3